<p class="kicker">Adopt · JRCv1 draft · no account</p>
<h1>Could your software survive without you?</h1>
<p class="lede">Point this at a public GitHub repository. You'll see, pillar by pillar, what's evidenced, what's missing and why, and an ordered path to fix it, with starter files you review before using any of them.</p>

<div class="notice">
  <p><strong>What this is:</strong> an automated scan of public files at one commit. Your browser reads them straight from GitHub (<code>api.github.com</code> and <code>raw.githubusercontent.com</code>, without sign-in). Nothing is sent to this site or stored.</p>
  <p><strong>What it isn't:</strong> a review, a verification or a certification. Finding a file shows it exists, not that it's correct. Not finding one shows only that it isn't in the repository.</p>
</div>

<form id="adopt-form" class="adopt-form" novalidate>
  <fieldset>
    <legend>What do you want to assess?</legend>
    <label><input type="radio" name="source" value="repository" checked> A public GitHub repository</label>
    <label><input type="radio" name="source" value="manifest"> A <code>jrc.json</code> manifest</label>
    <label><input type="radio" name="source" value="snapshot"> A saved evidence snapshot</label>
  </fieldset>

  <div data-panel="repository">
    <label for="adopt-repository">Repository URL</label>
    <input id="adopt-repository" name="repository" type="url" inputmode="url" autocomplete="url" spellcheck="false" maxlength="200" placeholder="https://github.com/owner/repo" aria-describedby="adopt-repository-help">
    <p id="adopt-repository-help" class="help">Public repositories only. GitHub allows 60 anonymous requests an hour per address, and one assessment uses about three API requests.</p>
    <label for="adopt-ref">Branch, tag or commit <span class="muted">(optional)</span></label>
    <input id="adopt-ref" name="ref" type="text" spellcheck="false" maxlength="100" placeholder="default branch">
  </div>

  <div data-panel="manifest" hidden>
    <label for="adopt-manifest">Paste <code>jrc.json</code></label>
    <textarea id="adopt-manifest" name="manifest" rows="8" spellcheck="false" aria-describedby="adopt-manifest-help"></textarea>
    <label for="adopt-manifest-file">or choose a file</label>
    <input id="adopt-manifest-file" name="manifestFile" type="file" accept="application/json,.json">
    <p id="adopt-manifest-help" class="help">Assessed in this page with the same engine as <code>jrc check</code>. Up to 64 KiB.</p>
  </div>

  <div data-panel="snapshot" hidden>
    <label for="adopt-snapshot-file">Evidence snapshot (<code>jrc-snapshot.json</code>)</label>
    <input id="adopt-snapshot-file" name="snapshotFile" type="file" accept="application/json,.json" aria-describedby="adopt-snapshot-help">
