  <p><button type="submit" class="primary">Assess</button></p>
</form>

<noscript><div class="notice"><p>This assessment runs in your browser and needs JavaScript. Without it, the command line does the same assessment: <code>npx --yes --package=github:jollyrogercharter/charter jrc assess https://github.com/OWNER/REPO</code></p></div></noscript>

